5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good evening. Let us begin this game with a calm and patient mind.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I'm going to find the werewolf and save everyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Let's start by observing. Since it's the first day, we have no concrete information.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I hope we can find the answer together peacefully.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll make sure the werewolf doesn't get away with it!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Mizuki. Observation is our best tool for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! Do you think you can tell who it is just by looking?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Not immediately, Rin. But patterns emerge over time.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think it's important that we all trust each other as much as possible.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Trust is fine, but we can't be too soft. We have to be brave!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,I wonder if the Seer is already thinking about who to check!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
