31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have a duty to inform you. Takumi, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! Already?! Jonathan, are you the Seer?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"That was incredibly fast. Jonathan, are you certain you want to reveal yourself so early?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, Takumi... is this true?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! No way! Jonathan is lying! I'm a villager!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear and unmistakable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Wow! If Jonathan is the Seer, then we found him on the first try!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a strong claim. However, if the werewolf claims to be the Seer, they can eliminate a villager.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It's hard to believe Takumi would be the werewolf, but the Seer's word is powerful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,He's just trying to frame me! Don't listen to him! I'm not the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The most logical path to victory is to remove the threat now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,I believe Jonathan! He seems too calm to be lying!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi, your reaction is quite aggressive. While that fits your personality, it doesn't help your case.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I feel bad for Takumi, but we must prioritize the village's safety.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, I'm just angry because I'm being lied about! This is unfair!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I stand by my result. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,Vote Takumi! Let's do it!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,The risk of ignoring a Seer's direct hit is too high. I'll vote Takumi.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll follow the majority. I'm sorry, Takumi.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all making a huge mistake!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
